  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Yogesh Kumar Trivedi vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Deptt. Of ... on 23 July, 2024 Author: Rajesh Singh Chauhan Bench: Rajesh Singh Chauhan High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad, Lucknow Bench ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc-Lko:49540 Court No. - 4 Case :- Writ - A No. - 5560 of 2024 Petitioner :- Yogesh Kumar Trivedi Respondent :- State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Deptt. Of Food Safety And Drug Administrat Counsel for Petitioner :- Sandeep Kumar Yadav,Abhay Pratap Yadav Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C. Hon'ble Rajesh Singh Chauhan,J. 1.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "2. By means of this petition, the petitioner has assailed the impugned transfer order dated 30.6.2024 passed by the opposite party no.3 i.e., Additional Commissioner (Administration), Department of Food Safety and Drug Administration, U.P., Lucknow transferring the petitioner from Balrampur to Sonbhadra in public interest. (iv) of the transfer policy, he had given option to the competent authority transferring him to any of the district namely, Lakhimpur Kheri, Barabanki or Unnao on 16.6.2024 (Annexure-3) but instead of transferring the petitioner pursuant to the option being submitted by him, he has been transferred to Sonbhadra, which is aspirational district. 4. Hence, he has prayed that a direction may be issued to the opposite party no. 2 i.e., Commissioner, Department of Food Safety and Drug Administration, U.P., Lucknow to decide the representation of the petitioner dated 2.7.2024 (Annexure-5). 5."
  },
